"yourself (beginners progress faster). Records: times you beat your "
"previous best in the last 4 weeks (3 per day at most). Consistency: days "
"trained in the last 4 weeks. Rank: your marks from the last 90 days, "
"adjusted for weight and sex; a record that jumps a lot at once doesn't "
"count until you repeat it."

